    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An outstanding fully renovated 3-bedroom terraced property with front and rear access in the popular Belcourt Development of Blackcastle Navan.\n\nThis prime property located in a quaint cul de sac within this mature development close to Navan Town Centre.\n\nThe property has been fully renovated in recent years and features all modern fixtutes and fittings.\n\nSpacious and bright living accommodation includes Entrance Hall, Lounge, Kitchen, Multi purpose room, Guest Wc 3 Bedrooms & Family Bathroom.\n\nThere is a back yard to rear with a block built shed and room for parking.\n\nBelcourt is only a stone's throw from Schools, Shops, and restaurants in the immediate area or a short stroll to Navan Town Centre with excellent transport links to Dublin City Centre.\n\nEarly viewing is highly advised to appreciate the sheer quality on offer behind the door of this superb home.\n\nAccommodation includes Entrance Hall, Lounge, Kitchen / Dining Room, Reception Room, Guest w.c., 3 Bedrooms and Bathroom.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.70 x 1.80\nWith tiled flooring.\n\nLounge - 4.74 x 3.06\nWith wooden flooring and open fire.\n\nKitchen/Dining - 5.00 x 3.01\nWith tiled flooring, built in wall and floor units, oven and hob.\n\nReception room - 3.46 x 1.75\nWith wooden flooring.\n\nGuest w.c. - 1.56 x 0.89\nWith tiled flooring, w.c and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.10 x 3.13\nWith carpet and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.22 x 3.13\nWith carpet and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.03 x 2.20\nWith carpet and built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.87 x 2.52\nWith tiled flooring, w.c, w.h.b and shower.\n\n\nFEATURES\n\n• Bright & spacious living accommodation\n• Recently renovated\n• Oil fired central heating\n• Excellent condition throughout\n• Walking distance to Navan Centre\n• High levels of insulation\n• Parking to rear\n• Front garden\n• Wired for alarm\n\nDIRECTONS\n\nFrom Dublin travel along the M3 and exit for Navan at Junction 8. Go straight towards Navan Town.\nAt the 5th set of traffic lights turn right up Flower Hill. At the top of flower hill take the 3rd exit off the roundabout out the Slane Road.\n\nEIRCODE: C15 H2K5"
      },
